s and faculty.","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utsa-ai-syllabus-expectations-001","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-utsa-ai-syllabus-expectations-001","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UTSA's faculty generative AI guide advises faculty to clearly state in the syllabus and course homepage whether and how AI use is allowed, while recognizing that faculty may choose different course approaches.","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/docs/genai_faculty_guide/utsa-faculty_generativeai_guidelines.pdf"]},{"id":"source_added:https://libguides.utsa.edu/c.php?g=1339606&p=9874084","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://libguides.utsa.edu/c.php?g=1339606&p=9874084"]},{"id":"source_added:https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/faculty-guide.html","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/faculty-guide.html"]},{"id":"source_added:https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/student-guide.html","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/artificial-intelligence/student-guide.html"]},{"id":"source_added:https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/docs/genai_faculty_guide/utsa-faculty_generativeai_guidelines.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://provost.utsa.edu/academicinnovation/docs/genai_faculty_guide/utsa-faculty_